
***********************************************************************
  Please use no stars (*) in file names; Windows can not handle them !
***********************************************************************

Prefer this notation:

 6-311++G** -->  6-311++G-star-star
 6-311+G*   -->  6-311+G-star 
 6-311G**   -->  6-311G-star-star   
 6-31G**    -->  6-31G-star-star

 3-21++G*   -->  3-21++G-star
 3-21G*     -->  3-21G-star
 .
 .
 .
 
